{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_20234","headline":"峡哀 十 · 孟郊","name":"峡哀 十","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"枭鸱作人语，蛟虯吸水波。\n能于白日间，谄欲晴风和。\n骇智蹶衆命，蕴腥布深萝。\n齿泉无底贫，锯涎在处多。\n仄树鸟不巢，踔𨃚猿相过\n峡哀不可听，峡怨其奈何。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"孟郊","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_20234.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_20234","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}